# Pulsar Bridge — pulsar-core-contracts

You are working inside **https://github.com/Pulsar-Bridge/Pulsar-core-contract**, the Soroban smart contract that is the
on-chain mirror of the `pulsar-core` off-chain relay, and the most mature repo in the
Pulsar Bridge system. This file is your standing brief for this repo. Read it before
making changes.

