## Sibling repos (fill in and clone before cross-repo work)

Downstream and upstream consumers of this contract's events/entry-points live in sibling
repos. Paste their clone URLs here, then clone them as siblings
(`../pulsar-core`, `../pulsar-web`) so you can check what actually depends on a given
event or entry-point before you change it.

```
pulsar-core:   <PASTE_CLONE_URL_HERE>
pulsar-web:    <PASTE_CLONE_URL_HERE>
pulsar-swap:   <PASTE_CLONE_URL_HERE_ONCE_IT_EXISTS>
```

To pull them in:
```
git clone <pulsar-core-url> ../pulsar-core
git clone <pulsar-web-url> ../pulsar-web
```

Before touching `EVENTS.md` or any `#[contractimpl]` signature, open the sibling repos
and grep for how they currently consume it — don't assume, check.

